---
import TrustLayout from '../components/TrustLayout.astro';
---

<TrustLayout
  locale="fr"
  title="Confiance & sécurité — Hatch"
  description="Hatch OS est conçu pour les réseaux exigeants : RGPD natif, données hébergées en Union européenne, aucune revente, zéro publicité."
>
  <!-- HERO -->
  <section style="background:#051309;padding:96px 32px 80px;">
    <div style="max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;">
      <div style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:rgba(56,102,65,0.18);border:1px solid rgba(56,102,65,0.35);border-radius:100px;padding:5px 14px 5px 10px;margin-bottom:24px;">
        <span style="width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#5aad6e;flex-shrink:0;box-shadow:0 0 8px rgba(90,173,110,0.7);"></span>
        <span style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5aad6e;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;">Confiance &amp; sécurité</span>
      </div>
      <h1 style="font-family:'Fraunces',Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,56px);font-weight:700;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.03em;color:#fff;margin:0 0 20px;">
        Votre réseau mérite un partenaire de <em style="font-style:italic;font-size:1.35em;color:#ea580c;">confiance.</em>
      </h1>
      <p style="font-size:clamp(16px,2vw,19px);color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);line-height:1.65;margin:0 0 40px;">
        Hatch OS est conçu pour les réseaux exigeants : RGPD natif, données hébergées en Union européenne, aucune revente, zéro publicité.
      </p>
      <a href="/conformite-ia" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;background:#ea580c;color:#fff;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;transition:background 0.15s;">Voir la conformité IA →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 01 – CE QUE NOUS NE FAISONS JAMAIS -->
  <section style="background:#fff;padding:72px 32px;">
    <div style="max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;">
      <p style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#ea580c;margin:0 0 10px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;">01</p>
      <h2 style="font-family:'Fraunces',Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,36px);font-weight:700;color:#0f1f10;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0 0 40px;line-height:1.1;">Ce que nous ne faisons jamais</h2>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:20px;">
        <div style="border:1.5px solid rgba(56,102,65,0.2);background:#f6fbf7;border-radius:16px;padding:28px 24px;">
          <div style="width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:10px;background:#386641;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:16px;">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff4a4" stroke-width="2.2"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#0f1f10;margin:0 0 8px;">Vos données ne sont jamais vendues.</h3>
          <p style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#4b6358;line-height:1.65;margin:0;">Nous ne monétisons pas vos données, quelles qu'elles soient. Votre confiance ne doit pas être un produit.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="border:1.5px solid rgba(56,102,65,0.2);background:#f6fbf7;border-radius:16px;padding:28px 24px;">
          <div style="width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:10px;background:#386641;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:16px;">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff4a4" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#0f1f10;margin:0 0 8px;">Vos données ne servent jamais à entraîner des modèles tiers.</h3>
          <p style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#4b6358;line-height:1.65;margin:0;">Ce que vous indexez dans Hatch reste dans votre agent. Aucune fuite vers des modèles publics ou partagés.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="border:1.5px solid rgba(56,102,65,0.2);background:#f6fbf7;border-radius:16px;padding:28px 24px;">
          <div style="width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:10px;background:#386641;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:16px;">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff4a4" stroke-width="2.2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="m15 9-6 6M9 9l6 6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#0f1f10;margin:0 0 8px;">Aucun cookie publicitaire.</h3>
          <p style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#4b6358;line-height:1.65;margin:0;">Pas de tracking tiers, pas de remarketing, pas de régie publicitaire. Uniquement les cookies strictement nécessaires au service.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 02 – INFRASTRUCTURE -->
  <section style="background:#f8fafc;padding:72px 32px;">
    <div style="max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;">
      <p style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#ea580c;margin:0 0 10px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;">02</p>
      <h2 style="font-family:'Fraunces',Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,36px);font-weight:700;color:#0f1f10;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0 0 8px;line-height:1.1;">Une infrastructure pensée pour l'Europe</h2>
      <p style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:#4b6358;margin:0 0 32px;">Vos données sont hébergées par défaut en Union européenne. Les exceptions sont documentées et encadrées.</p>
      <div style="overflow-x:auto;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);">
        <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:14px;">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th style="background:#f1f5f9;text-align:left;padding:12px 18px;font-weight:600;font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.07em;color:#6b7280;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;">Composant</th>
              <th style="background:#f1f5f9;text-align:left;padding:12px 18px;font-weight:600;font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.07em;color:#6b7280;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;">Fournisseur</th>
              <th style="background:#f1f5f9;text-align:left;padding:12px 18px;font-weight:600;font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.07em;color:#6b7280;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;">Localisation</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:13px 18px;color:#374151;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;font-weight:500;">Base de données</td>
              <td style="padding:13px 18px;color:#374151;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;">Supabase (PostgreSQL)</td>
              <td style="padding:13px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;"><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;background:#dcfce7;color:#166534;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:100px;">🇪🇺 Europe (eu-west-1)</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:13px 18px;color:#374151;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;font-weight:500;">Hébergement &amp; CDN</td>
              <td style="padding:13px 18px;color:#374151;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;">Vercel</td>
              <td style="padding:13px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;"><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;background:#dcfce7;color:#166534;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:100px;">🇪🇺 Europe</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:13px 18px;color:#374151;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;font-weight:500;">Modèles d'IA</td>
              <td style="padding:13px 18px;color:#374151;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;">Google Gemini / Anthropic Claude</td>
              <td style="padding:13px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;"><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:100px;">🇺🇸 États-Unis *</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:13px 18px;color:#374151;font-weight:500;">Messagerie</td>
              <td style="padding:13px 18px;color:#374151;">WhatsApp Business API (Meta)</td>
              <td style="padding:13px 18px;"><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:100px;">UE / États-Unis *</span></td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#6b7280;margin:12px 0 0;">* Transferts encadrés par des clauses contractuelles types (CCT) conformes au RGPD.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 03 – CERTIFICATIONS -->
  <section style="background:#fff;padding:72px 32px;">
    <div style="max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;">
      <p style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#ea580c;margin:0 0 10px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;">03</p>
      <h2 style="font-family:'Fraunces',Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,36px);font-weight:700;color:#0f1f10;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0 0 32px;line-height:1.1;">Certifications &amp; audits</h2>
      <div style="overflow-x:auto;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);">
        <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:14px;">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th style="background:#f1f5f9;text-align:left;padding:12px 18px;font-weight:600;font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.07em;color:#6b7280;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;">Certification</th>
              <th style="background:#f1f5f9;text-align:left;padding:12px 18px;font-weight:600;font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.07em;color:#6b7280;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;">Statut</th>
              <th style="background:#f1f5f9;text-align:left;padding:12px 18px;font-weight:600;font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.07em;color:#6b7280;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;">Commentaire</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:13px 18px;color:#374151;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;font-weight:600;">RGPD</td>
              <td style="padding:13px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;"><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;background:#dcfce7;color:#166534;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:100px;">✓ Conforme</span></td>
              <td style="padding:13px 18px;color:#4b6358;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;">DPO désigné, registre de traitement tenu</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:13px 18px;color:#374151;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;font-weight:600;">SOC 2 Type II</td>
              <td style="padding:13px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;"><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:100px;">⏳ En cours</span></td>
              <td style="padding:13px 18px;color:#4b6358;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;">Audit lancé mi-2026</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:13px 18px;color:#374151;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;font-weight:600;">ISO 27001</td>
              <td style="padding:13px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;"><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;background:#f1f5f9;color:#6b7280;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:100px;">— Non applicable pour l'instant</span></td>
              <td style="padding:13px 18px;color:#4b6358;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;">Envisagé à partir de 50 établissements actifs</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:13px 18px;color:#374151;font-weight:600;">Hébergement EU</td>
              <td style="padding:13px 18px;"><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;background:#dcfce7;color:#166534;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:100px;">✓ Conforme</span></td>
              <td style="padding:13px 18px;color:#4b6358;">Supabase eu-west-1, Vercel région Europe</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 04 – VOS DONNÉES SONT LES VÔTRES -->
  <section style="background:#f8fafc;padding:72px 32px;">
    <div style="max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:48px;align-items:start;">
      <div>
        <p style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#ea580c;margin:0 0 10px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;">04</p>
        <h2 style="font-family:'Fraunces',Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,36px);font-weight:700;color:#0f1f10;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0 0 16px;line-height:1.1;">Vos données sont les vôtres</h2>
        <p style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:#4b6358;line-height:1.7;margin:0;">Hatch OS agit en tant que <strong style="color:#0f1f10;">sous-traitant</strong> au sens du RGPD. Vous restez le responsable du traitement. Cela signifie :</p>
      </div>
      <ul style="list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;padding-top:48px;">
        <li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;">
          <span style="width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#386641;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;">
            <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 10" fill="none"><path d="M1 5l3.5 3.5L11 1" stroke="#fff4a4" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span><strong style="color:#0f1f10;">Accès :</strong> vous exportez vos données à tout moment, sans frais ni délai.</span>
        </li>
        <li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;">
          <span style="width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#386641;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;">
            <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 10" fill="none"><path d="M1 5l3.5 3.5L11 1" stroke="#fff4a4" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span><strong style="color:#0f1f10;">Suppression :</strong> demandez la suppression de votre compte, toutes les données sont effacées sous 30 jours.</span>
        </li>
        <li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;">
          <span style="width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#386641;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;">
            <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 10" fill="none"><path d="M1 5l3.5 3.5L11 1" stroke="#fff4a4" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span><strong style="color:#0f1f10;">Portabilité :</strong> export JSON ou CSV sur simple demande.</span>
        </li>
        <li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;">
          <span style="width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#386641;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;">
            <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 12 10" fill="none"><path d="M1 5l3.5 3.5L11 1" stroke="#fff4a4" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span>Aucune rétention post-contrat au-delà des obligations légales (10 ans pour la facturation).</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 05 – ENCART DSI -->
  <section style="background:#fff;padding:72px 32px;">
    <div style="max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;">
      <div style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0a1f0b 0%,#112515 100%);border-radius:20px;padding:40px 44px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);">
        <p style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5aad6e;margin:0 0 10px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;">05 — Pour les équipes DSI</p>
        <h2 style="font-family:'Fraunces',Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(20px,2.5vw,30px);font-weight:700;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0 0 8px;line-height:1.2;">Un mot pour les équipes DSI</h2>
        <p style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);margin:0 0 24px;line-height:1.65;">Vous devez valider un outil IA avant de le déployer dans votre réseau ?</p>
        <ul style="list-style:none;margin:0 0 32px;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;">
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);line-height:1.6;">
            <span style="width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(90,173,110,0.25);border:1px solid rgba(90,173,110,0.4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;">
              <svg width="8" height="8" viewBox="0 0 10 8" fill="none"><path d="M1 4l2.8 2.8L9 1" stroke="#5aad6e" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span><strong style="color:#fff;">Authentification :</strong> SSO SAML 2.0 (en cours d'intégration)</span>
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);line-height:1.6;">
            <span style="width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(90,173,110,0.25);border:1px solid rgba(90,173,110,0.4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;">
              <svg width="8" height="8" viewBox="0 0 10 8" fill="none"><path d="M1 4l2.8 2.8L9 1" stroke="#5aad6e" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span><strong style="color:#fff;">Chiffrement :</strong> TLS 1.3 en transit, AES-256 au repos</span>
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);line-height:1.6;">
            <span style="width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(90,173,110,0.25);border:1px solid rgba(90,173,110,0.4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;">
              <svg width="8" height="8" viewBox="0 0 10 8" fill="none"><path d="M1 4l2.8 2.8L9 1" stroke="#5aad6e" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span><strong style="color:#fff;">Journalisation :</strong> tous les accès aux données sont audités et conservés 12 mois</span>
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);line-height:1.6;">
            <span style="width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(90,173,110,0.25);border:1px solid rgba(90,173,110,0.4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;">
              <svg width="8" height="8" viewBox="0 0 10 8" fill="none"><path d="M1 4l2.8 2.8L9 1" stroke="#5aad6e" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span><strong style="color:#fff;">Isolation des données :</strong> chaque réseau dispose de son espace isolé (row-level security PostgreSQL)</span>
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);line-height:1.6;">
            <span style="width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(90,173,110,0.25);border:1px solid rgba(90,173,110,0.4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;">
              <svg width="8" height="8" viewBox="0 0 10 8" fill="none"><path d="M1 4l2.8 2.8L9 1" stroke="#5aad6e" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span><strong style="color:#fff;">API REST documentée :</strong> compatible avec vos outils de supervision (SIEM, DLP)</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <a href="mailto:cesar@gethatch.io" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:#fff4a4;color:#1a2e1c;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;padding:11px 22px;border-radius:9px;text-decoration:none;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;">
          Contacter l'équipe technique
        </a>
